  // model supports up to 65,535 output tokens; doubling the cap here costs
  // nothing for a normal short reply (billed by tokens actually used, not by
  // the ceiling) but gives real headroom before hitting it.
  MAX_TOKENS:       16_384,
  // gemini-2.5-flash thinking tokens are billed from the same maxOutputTokens
  // pool as the visible reply. 0 (fully disabled) was tried per an explicit
  // request, but with 9 function declarations in play it badly hurt
